WEBVTT

00:04.970 --> 00:09.182
This arrow is irreplaceable.
There's only one, you know.

00:09.474 --> 00:11.809
It's essential to my mission.

00:12.435 --> 00:14.103
Losing it is not an option.

00:16.565 --> 00:18.191
Leave that arrow right there!

00:18.400 --> 00:19.943
He'll bleed out!

00:22.070 --> 00:26.570
Because of my blockhead brother,
I have no choice but to kill you now.

00:27.951 --> 00:31.663
You do know
nothing can happen to this arrow.

00:31.746 --> 00:35.624
I can't let it break or catch the eye
of some neighborhood crone.

00:36.418 --> 00:38.711
I tend to be very meticulous,
you see.

00:38.795 --> 00:41.923
It is in my nature to return
this arrow to its proper place.

00:42.257 --> 00:46.344
Certainly, after listening
to one CD in its entirety

00:46.428 --> 00:49.472
you return it to its case
before listening to another?

00:49.931 --> 00:51.557
That is what
everyone does.

00:52.017 --> 00:53.560
That is what I do.

00:56.855 --> 00:59.858
Oh? So you've decided to
enter our abode?

00:59.941 --> 01:01.275
No shit, Sherlock!

01:01.359 --> 01:05.859
How else would I beat your ass
and bring Koichi back to normal?!

01:07.574 --> 01:10.660
Bro! I'm not down
for the count yet!

01:10.785 --> 01:13.078
Wait for me
before you attack!

01:13.163 --> 01:13.913
Attack?

01:14.289 --> 01:17.959
This fight's just getting started!

01:18.960 --> 01:20.211
Up there, in the dark…

01:20.879 --> 01:22.088
something's coming!

01:52.035 --> 01:54.370
JOJO'S BIZARRE ADVENTURE
DIAMOND IS UNBREAKABLE

01:55.580 --> 01:58.874
<i>These faceless gazes pass by one another</i>

01:59.250 --> 02:02.544
<i>A wound to the heart changes our everyday</i>

02:02.796 --> 02:07.296
<i>Encounters without boundaries
The bizarre is our normal U-yeh</i>

02:09.761 --> 02:13.097
<i>These ordinary mornings,
we're laughing on the surface</i>

02:13.181 --> 02:16.767
<i>Mysteries drawn to each other,
identity still unknown</i>

02:16.851 --> 02:21.351
<i>Without a heads up,
it's quietly lurking somewhere in this town</i>

02:25.986 --> 02:30.486
<i>Although we bicker and complain
In the end, we celebrate</i>

02:33.034 --> 02:36.412
<i>Dancing through the everyday</i>

02:36.496 --> 02:40.996
<i>Crazy Noisy Bizarre Town</i>

02:52.846 --> 02:57.100
EPISODE 4
THE NIJIMURA BROTHERS, PART 2

02:55.974 --> 02:57.121
Okuyasu…

02:57.726 --> 03:00.061
Your stupidity is all-encompassing.

03:00.895 --> 03:02.646
If you hadn't stumbled in here,

03:02.731 --> 03:06.693
Worse Company would have
already destroyed Josuke.

03:07.068 --> 03:10.905
What's more, you
walked right into the line of fire.

03:11.239 --> 03:13.616
Bro…

03:13.908 --> 03:15.993
Your Stand, The Hand,
may be menacing,

03:16.077 --> 03:18.370
but you, little brother,
are a sad sack.

03:18.455 --> 03:21.374
The incompetent will
always hinder the capable…

03:21.750 --> 03:24.586
I've told you over and over,
ever since we were children.

03:25.420 --> 03:28.297
Plus, life is only worth living
when it has growth…

03:28.631 --> 03:30.924
You've heard that
from me many times, too…

03:31.843 --> 03:34.220
<i>What the hell
are these wounds?</i>

03:34.637 --> 03:37.598
<i>What kind of attack leaves
damage like that?</i>

03:38.183 --> 03:40.810
<i>Whatever it is,
he's hiding something.</i>

03:41.186 --> 03:42.604
Little brother.

03:42.896 --> 03:44.606
You know, it's idiots like you

03:44.773 --> 03:47.692
who deserve to die like
a roach on its back!

03:50.236 --> 03:51.779
More tiny holes!

03:51.863 --> 03:54.240
What the hell is doing that?

03:54.616 --> 03:56.826
Shining Diamond!

03:59.662 --> 04:02.414
You're gonna attack
your brother, too?!

04:12.050 --> 04:14.385
Josuke Higashikata…

04:16.471 --> 04:20.224
He'd never abandon
this little brat, Koichi.

04:21.142 --> 04:23.936
He'll be back for sure.

04:25.939 --> 04:27.982
I'll be the one to blot him out…

04:28.650 --> 04:32.153
I'll kill anyone who gets in the way
of this bow and arrow,

04:33.154 --> 04:35.739
anyone with a pulse!

04:42.705 --> 04:46.959
Now, then… I think it's time
you tell me 'bout your brother's Stand.

04:49.003 --> 04:50.921
What is his Stand?

04:51.089 --> 04:53.633
Spill it, and I'll get rid of
these holes on your face.

04:54.551 --> 04:58.721
Like… I'd tell you…

04:59.055 --> 05:00.473
You sucker…

05:01.015 --> 05:02.558
Oh well…

05:04.227 --> 05:08.231
Then I guess,
that's the way it's gonna be!

05:14.737 --> 05:19.237
All right, I'm going in.
Just stay outta my way, Okuyasu.

05:20.285 --> 05:23.162
Koichi's living on
borrowed time!

05:34.090 --> 05:38.469
<i>His Stand's gonna attack
from somewhere in the dark.</i>

05:39.387 --> 05:42.598
<i>This is definitely gonna suck.</i>

05:43.766 --> 05:47.269
<i>Senses, don't fail me now..</i>

05:47.395 --> 05:48.646
Hey, where are you going!

05:48.730 --> 05:49.564
Huh?

05:49.647 --> 05:50.939
Why, Josuke?

05:51.149 --> 05:53.234
Why did you heal me?

05:53.401 --> 05:54.944
Pipe down. Later, later.

05:55.111 --> 05:57.655
I might attack you!

05:57.906 --> 06:00.116
I am your enemy!

06:00.200 --> 06:01.201
You serious?

06:01.534 --> 06:05.287
Depends on your answer!
Why did you heal me?

06:05.496 --> 06:09.625
I'm not some genius.
Hurry up and tell me already!

06:09.876 --> 06:11.711
And what about your hand?!

06:11.920 --> 06:15.131
He got you when you were
pulling me out here, didn't he?

06:15.715 --> 06:20.215
Why the hell'd you go
through all that to save me?

06:22.305 --> 06:24.056
Nothing too complicated.

06:25.558 --> 06:27.476
Didn't think anyone
needed to die.

06:28.228 --> 06:29.854
That's all.

06:39.656 --> 06:40.865
<i>Koichi..</i>

06:50.041 --> 06:51.917
<i>He was taken upstairs.</i>

07:10.937 --> 07:13.022
I'm not done
asking questions, Josuke!

07:13.106 --> 07:14.273
What the hell?!

07:14.482 --> 07:16.358
Now, please,
just let me save Koichi!

07:16.442 --> 07:17.443
Why?!

07:17.652 --> 07:21.447
Why don't you use your Stand
to fix your hand?

07:21.656 --> 07:25.618
Just make it all better
like you did my face!

07:26.744 --> 07:30.831
My Shining Diamond can't
heal my own wounds.

07:31.749 --> 07:35.878
Life isn't always easy, is it?

07:36.379 --> 07:37.963
And there's another thing…

07:38.464 --> 07:41.133
No matter how hard I try,
I can't bring back the dead.

07:43.011 --> 07:45.221
Last thing, Okuyasu.

07:45.471 --> 07:47.764
I don't know how yet,
but if Koichi doesn't make it,

07:47.849 --> 07:50.226
I'm gonna punish your brother.

07:50.685 --> 07:51.727
So be pissed off at him!

07:52.186 --> 07:54.771
This is all your brother's fault.

07:56.107 --> 07:57.108
Got it?

07:57.525 --> 07:59.276
If you do,
stay outside.

08:16.210 --> 08:17.002
Koichi!

08:18.046 --> 08:20.673
<i>Shit… This is all a trap.</i>

08:20.757 --> 08:24.051
<i>He'll ambush me as
soon as I get close to Koichi</i>

08:24.385 --> 08:25.260
<i>But…</i>

08:25.553 --> 08:29.431
Trap or not,
now's all I got!

08:29.557 --> 08:33.185
Koichi hasn't a second to spare!

08:35.396 --> 08:36.146
What?!

08:36.564 --> 08:37.982
Okuyasu, you bastard!

08:38.066 --> 08:39.776
Josuke!

08:44.155 --> 08:45.072
Koichi…

08:46.240 --> 08:48.033
I don't have smarts.

08:48.368 --> 08:51.245
I think with my heart
instead of my head.

08:51.579 --> 08:54.665
Once, and only once, I'll repay you
for what you did for me.

08:54.749 --> 08:56.167
But nothing more.

08:56.250 --> 08:58.001
I won't help my Bro,

08:58.086 --> 09:00.338
and I won't do anything
beyond what I promised you.

09:01.589 --> 09:03.132
This is it.

09:06.844 --> 09:09.388
That's great to hear, Okuyasu.

09:18.314 --> 09:21.275
You held up pretty
great back there, Koichi!

09:21.442 --> 09:23.444
Can't tell you how happy I am
to see you awake.

09:23.778 --> 09:25.070
So how many fingers?

09:26.697 --> 09:27.739
Five…

09:27.949 --> 09:31.410
I remember my neck was slammed
in between the gates,

09:31.869 --> 09:33.495
and then, uh… um…

09:34.705 --> 09:36.206
Wh-Where are we?

09:36.874 --> 09:38.542
Hate to break it to you,
Koichi,

09:38.626 --> 09:41.211
but things haven't
gotten any better.

09:41.504 --> 09:43.255
Nothing I'd like more than
to walk down those stairs

09:43.339 --> 09:46.008
and get
the hell out of here.

09:46.634 --> 09:51.013
But something tells me Okuyasu's bro
wouldn't exactly comply…

09:58.187 --> 10:00.189
<i>There's definitely
something up there.</i>

10:00.481 --> 10:03.775
<i>Something's lurking
where I can't see it.</i>

10:07.947 --> 10:08.656
<i>What was that?</i>

10:08.739 --> 10:11.116
<i>Something scurried that way</i>

10:11.200 --> 10:13.160
Josuke, what's going on?

10:13.244 --> 10:16.747
Koichi, I know none of this
makes any sense,

10:16.831 --> 10:19.708
but for now, keep quiet,
and stay close.

10:20.251 --> 10:23.254
<i>It was a helluva lot creepier
when I couldn't see it.</i>

10:23.337 --> 10:25.756
<i>Getting that peek was a relief</i>

10:25.840 --> 10:28.551
<i>Looks like we've got
a little runt on our hands.</i>

10:30.595 --> 10:34.348
<i>As soon as that little shit
shows himself,</i>

10:34.849 --> 10:38.394
<i>I'll blast him to kingdom come
with Shining Diamond</i>

10:39.896 --> 10:41.063
There you are!

10:42.190 --> 10:44.108
What the…?
There's a ton of them!

10:44.192 --> 10:45.610
And they're in uniform…

10:47.945 --> 10:49.071
Wh-What's…

10:52.992 --> 10:55.744
We're being ambushed
by a bunch of toy paratroopers…

10:56.162 --> 10:58.622
This is his brother's Stand?

11:00.249 --> 11:01.333
Ow!

11:02.210 --> 11:03.336
Mother…!

11:09.050 --> 11:13.429
Getting just two or three
of 'em won't be enough.

11:13.513 --> 11:17.099
They leave small wounds,
but they can definitely do some damage.

11:17.558 --> 11:21.228
They'll hurt us bad
if we try to fight them.

11:22.230 --> 11:26.730
Since Okuyasu decided to
meddle and save that brat,

11:27.652 --> 11:29.445
my plan has gone
somewhat awry.

11:29.695 --> 11:33.240
But you'll never escape
this house…

11:33.324 --> 11:35.492
or the domination of my perfectly
synchronized Stand,

11:35.576 --> 11:39.079
Worse Company!

11:43.793 --> 11:46.128
WORSE COMPANY
KEICHO NIJIMURA

11:50.383 --> 11:52.635
Worse Company?

11:55.429 --> 11:57.264
Josuke, wh-what's…

11:57.348 --> 11:58.307
Questions later.

11:58.432 --> 12:00.934
I know this is crazy…
Keep quiet and stay back!

12:01.018 --> 12:02.102
Shit's about to hit the fan!

12:02.228 --> 12:04.355
All units, halt!

12:05.106 --> 12:07.441
Ready, aim…

12:09.193 --> 12:10.235
Fire!

12:12.029 --> 12:13.780
Left face!

12:14.115 --> 12:15.574
Fire!

12:21.163 --> 12:24.875
Damn, head on, they've got the
fire power to blow us to smithereens!

12:26.669 --> 12:28.671
Lucky!
We've got windows!

12:28.796 --> 12:30.547
Koichi, I know
it's the second floor,

12:30.631 --> 12:32.716
but we've gotta break
those windows and jump to safety.

12:34.510 --> 12:36.303
So much for that idea…

12:40.891 --> 12:44.311
Great…
They've got helicopters.

12:44.478 --> 12:48.315
They're using U.S. Army
Apache helicopters?!

12:50.693 --> 12:52.319
Look out! A tank!

13:04.665 --> 13:06.917
Those are definitely tanks.

13:07.335 --> 13:08.836
Koichi, be caref–

13:09.170 --> 13:09.920
What?

13:10.129 --> 13:14.508
Wh-What did you just say,
Koichi? You can see them?

13:14.592 --> 13:17.052
The soldiers, tanks,
and helicopters…

13:17.136 --> 13:18.220
All of them?

13:19.180 --> 13:23.680
Yeah. I don't understand what's
going on, but I can see them.

13:23.768 --> 13:27.730
So that arrow…
it did give you a Stand!

13:28.189 --> 13:31.066
Oh? So the shrimp got one!

13:32.360 --> 13:36.860
He's finally got the power
to use a Stand, huh?!

13:38.366 --> 13:41.619
So, if it isn't Okuyasu's bro.

13:41.702 --> 13:43.412
Pretty ballsy move there…

13:43.663 --> 13:46.457
Showing off your Stand like that!

13:49.502 --> 13:53.088
Think of my Stand, Worse Company,
as a cast-iron defense.

13:53.381 --> 13:57.718
It renders any attack or
intruder utterly inert.

13:57.885 --> 14:00.596
I know you're just itching
to put me out of commission…

14:01.889 --> 14:06.389
But I promise you
your Shining Diamond's attacks

14:07.144 --> 14:09.104
will never get
anywhere close to me!

14:11.565 --> 14:12.774
Feast your eyes on this!

14:13.234 --> 14:17.613
The perfect symmetry of my
army's formation is stunning, isn't it?

14:17.697 --> 14:22.076
All units, maintain battle
formation! At ease!

14:23.744 --> 14:27.664
There's nothing like having
everything beautifully in place.

14:27.915 --> 14:31.043
Though you did knock off
a few of my foot soldiers back there,

14:31.335 --> 14:35.213
so my troop's formation is
irritatingly imperfect now.

14:36.006 --> 14:38.174
You are a meticulous bastard,
aren't you?

14:38.509 --> 14:41.678
You came out here
to tell us that?

14:41.846 --> 14:44.181
No, my reason for
showing myself

14:44.557 --> 14:46.725
is to observe you,
little trouble maker.

14:48.269 --> 14:49.019
M-Me?

14:49.103 --> 14:50.062
Indeed.

14:50.354 --> 14:52.230
Koichi, was it?

14:52.440 --> 14:56.485
How ironic that you appear to have
the innate capability for Stands.

14:56.777 --> 15:00.781
Manifest your Stand immediately,
and show me what it can do.

15:00.948 --> 15:05.448
You might just have the power
I've been looking for!

15:07.288 --> 15:10.582
Do it, and I'll let you live!

15:12.126 --> 15:12.543
B-But…

15:12.626 --> 15:14.461
The ability
you're looking for?

15:14.545 --> 15:16.880
Just what the hell
are you trying to do?

15:17.006 --> 15:20.843
I'll be asking the questions
around here, Josuke!

15:21.510 --> 15:23.970
Keep in mind I still have you
in my crosshairs!

15:24.054 --> 15:26.890
Be grateful you got
to live this long!

15:26.974 --> 15:28.016
Great.

15:28.142 --> 15:29.810
Hey, what're you waiting for?

15:29.977 --> 15:31.687
Manifest your Stand, brat!

15:32.021 --> 15:35.482
S-Stand? I don't have a clue
of what you're talking about!

15:35.566 --> 15:37.359
What?
This is your first time?

15:37.568 --> 15:39.069
No wonder!

15:39.153 --> 15:43.574
Very well! Josuke, show him how
to manifest his Stand!

15:43.657 --> 15:44.574
Huh?

15:44.700 --> 15:48.870
Your Shining Diamond's range
is a measly one meter.

15:49.288 --> 15:53.788
If the little wimp's Stand
can compensate for yours,

15:54.293 --> 15:57.546
you might be able to
escape my Company.

15:59.006 --> 16:03.468
True… A Stand that could
kick your ass would be awesome.

16:05.012 --> 16:08.348
Okay, materializing your
Stand is easy, Koichi.

16:08.849 --> 16:10.559
All you've got to do is

16:10.684 --> 16:13.770
ramp up the urge to protect
yourself, or to beat him into a pulp.

16:13.854 --> 16:14.604
Huh?

16:14.688 --> 16:17.065
The rest is instinct.

16:18.692 --> 16:21.736
A Stand unique to your
spiritual energy should reveal itself.

16:21.987 --> 16:23.071
W-Wait!

16:23.155 --> 16:24.781
You can't just
spring that on me

16:24.865 --> 16:26.575
and expect me
to know what to do!

16:26.659 --> 16:28.243
Don't know what to do, huh?

16:28.327 --> 16:32.622
Then I suppose I'll just have to
give you the inspiration!

16:34.375 --> 16:36.251
Do it, Green Beret!

16:46.637 --> 16:47.304
What?!

16:47.388 --> 16:48.305
That's…

17:01.485 --> 17:04.446
Come on, Koichi,
try moving it.

17:04.530 --> 17:05.781
M-Move what?

17:05.906 --> 17:07.490
That Stand!

17:07.741 --> 17:08.992
Stand?

17:09.910 --> 17:12.454
I-I made this thing?!

17:12.746 --> 17:14.456
Okay, now what?

17:14.582 --> 17:17.251
What can this
egg-shaped thing do?

17:17.501 --> 17:19.002
What can it do?

17:19.086 --> 17:22.380
I'm sorry to disappoint you,
but that's all I've got!

17:22.756 --> 17:24.132
That's it!

17:24.216 --> 17:26.134
What?
That's it?!

17:28.971 --> 17:30.013
<i>This Stand..</i>

17:31.140 --> 17:34.059
Enough! I've seen all
I need to see!

17:34.435 --> 17:37.146
All units, ready!

17:38.355 --> 17:39.939
Koichi, withdraw your Stand!

17:40.024 --> 17:42.651
If they destroy your Stand,
you'll die, too!

17:42.776 --> 17:45.737
Withdraw?
How do I make it withdraw?!

17:45.821 --> 17:47.781
Attack!

17:59.460 --> 18:00.836
J-Josuke!

18:02.004 --> 18:05.090
<i>Excellent. Koichi and Josuke
have been separated</i>

18:05.674 --> 18:07.342
<i>The crack in that egg…</i>

18:07.426 --> 18:10.929
<i>The brat doesn't realize it,
but he might have something there.</i>

18:11.138 --> 18:14.266
<i>The only man dying here
is Josuke.</i>

18:15.643 --> 18:16.644
Ouch…

18:17.102 --> 18:19.354
Hey, bro,

18:19.521 --> 18:23.816
if you're gonna bring
down this dump in a ball of fire,

18:24.652 --> 18:26.737
then quit playing around
and bring it!

18:38.040 --> 18:41.752
I'm in the mood for
a great brawl.

18:45.673 --> 18:47.591
Josuke Higashikata…

18:47.800 --> 18:50.677
Is it true you
strongly disapprove of

18:50.761 --> 18:53.472
disparaging remarks
about your hair?

18:53.639 --> 18:57.225
Why don't you go ahead
and find out for yourself?

18:57.434 --> 18:59.936
No, that won't be
necessary.

19:00.270 --> 19:03.022
I'll blow off your head right
from underneath

19:03.107 --> 19:06.276
that prized hair of yours;
consider yourself forewarned.

19:06.777 --> 19:10.447
But first, Worse Company will
fire bullets into your legs.

19:10.823 --> 19:12.533
Running away
will be impossible.

19:12.616 --> 19:14.701
Next we'll take aim
at your arms.

19:15.202 --> 19:17.120
You'll have
no means of defense.

19:17.204 --> 19:19.539
That's when I finally
get to blow away

19:19.623 --> 19:22.751
your brains
and your hair.

19:23.711 --> 19:26.755
Interesting. Sounds like
a bullet-proof tactic to me…

19:27.381 --> 19:30.926
That is, if you overlook that
it's completely impossible!

19:31.593 --> 19:33.970
I tend to be very meticulous,
you see.

19:34.054 --> 19:36.097
When I say I'll do something,
I do it.

19:36.223 --> 19:37.766
Thus the forewarning.

19:38.517 --> 19:40.018
<i>He's wide open…</i>

19:40.936 --> 19:43.855
<i>I just need to make
that Stand thing appear again.</i>

19:44.690 --> 19:48.860
<i>It's only an egg,
but if I can somehow hurl it at him,</i>

19:49.278 --> 19:51.321
<i>I might be able to beat him!</i>

19:51.613 --> 19:54.907
<i>I-I can do this!
Time to suck it up!</i>

19:56.076 --> 19:57.952
<i>I'm gonna beat him!</i>

19:59.413 --> 20:01.790
Your Stand intrigues me,

20:02.082 --> 20:04.334
so I'll let you live for now!

20:05.586 --> 20:06.670
You bastard!

20:06.754 --> 20:09.882
All units, charge!

20:16.597 --> 20:21.097
Like Moses parting the
waters of the Red Sea,

20:22.102 --> 20:26.602
I'm gonna break through
your army and beat you down!

20:27.191 --> 20:28.525
Fool!

20:28.609 --> 20:31.945
My plan is proceeding
exactly as I forewarned,

20:32.029 --> 20:34.114
Josuke Higashikata!

20:38.702 --> 20:39.661
<i>A l-landmine?!</i>

20:39.787 --> 20:41.663
First, your legs will go!

20:41.747 --> 20:44.916
And now, Apaches,
fire your missiles!

20:53.884 --> 20:54.843
My arm…

20:57.137 --> 20:59.430
First the legs, then the arms.

20:59.515 --> 21:02.142
It feels so wonderful when
things go exactly as predicted.

21:02.392 --> 21:05.645
I wonder if your wounded arms
will save you as

21:05.729 --> 21:08.356
Worse Company
pummels you

21:08.440 --> 21:12.940
with every one of its missiles,
shells, and rounds!

21:14.321 --> 21:17.782
You lose,
Josuke Higashikata!

21:18.492 --> 21:20.202
All units!

21:21.745 --> 21:24.330
Ready, aim…!

21:28.836 --> 21:32.005
And what do you think you're
doing, Josuke Higashikata?

21:32.548 --> 21:34.883
Finally accepting your fate?

21:36.468 --> 21:39.596
Are you asking me
to let you go?

21:41.515 --> 21:43.016
Well, no can do.

21:44.351 --> 21:46.728
All units, fire!

21:50.774 --> 21:54.861
I've already
implemented my tactics.

21:56.738 --> 21:57.739
What?!

21:59.825 --> 22:02.244
Those are the missiles
I shot at Josuke's arm…

22:02.953 --> 22:05.205
Those are my missiles!

22:09.877 --> 22:11.461
Did ya forget?

22:11.837 --> 22:16.337
My Shining Diamond repairs
stuff that's broken.

22:18.385 --> 22:20.303
If you're getting forgetful,

22:20.387 --> 22:21.930
you might want to
start taking notes.

22:22.764 --> 22:24.807
You know,
meticulously.

23:38.298 --> 23:40.049
EPISODE 5
THE NIJIMURA BROTHERS, PART 3
